hailing from my office

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.160
at the American Museum of Natural History,

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.180
right here in New York City.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.320
- Do you ever go home?

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.110
I mean seriously, do you ever go home?

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:54.840
- My home is the universe,
so wherever I am I'm home.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:57.950
- I don't think your family
would appreciate that answer.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.270
(laughing)

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:00.630
- All right Neil, what time is it?

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:03.100
